    "text": "Seofonfealde gifa sind Haliges gastes; and seofon stapas sindon ciriclicra grada & haligra hada; and\nAnd eallum Godes freondum gebira\u00f0 swi\u00f0e rihte, \u00fe\u00e6t hi Godes cirican lufian & wur\u00f0ian & Godes\nAnd se \u00fee heom gederige mid worde o\u00f0\u00f0e weorce, seofonfealdre bote gebete hit georne be \u00feam \u00fee seo\nFor\u00f0am halidom & hadas & gehalgode Godes hus a man sceal for Godes ege wur\u00f0ian georne.\nAnd to hadbote, gif liflire wur\u00f0e, toeacan \u00feam rihtwere, \u00feone forman st\u00e6pe bete man mid punde & mid\nAnd to hadbote, gif feorhlira wur\u00f0e, toeacan \u00feam rihtwere, \u00e6t \u00feam o\u00f0rum st\u00e6pe twa pund to bote mid\nAnd to hadbote, gif fulbrice wyr\u00f0e, toeacan \u00feam rihtwere, \u00e6t \u00feam \u00feriddan st\u00e6pe \u00fereo pund to bote mid\nAnd to hadbote, gif fulbryce wyr\u00f0e, toeacan \u00feam rihtwere, \u00e6t \u00feam feor\u00f0an st\u00e6pe feower pund to bote,\nAnd to hadbote gif fulbrice wyr\u00f0e, \u00e6t \u00feam V st\u00e6pe V pund to bote, mid godcundan scrifte.\nAnd to hadbote, gif fulbrice wur\u00f0e, toeacan \u00feam rihtwere, \u00e6t \u00feam VI st\u00e6pe VI pund to bote, mid\nAnd to hadbote, gif fulbrice wur\u00f0e, toeacan \u00feam rihtwere, \u00e6t \u00feam seofo\u00f0an st\u00e6pe VII pund to bote, mid\nAnd to hadbote, \u00fear sambryce wyr\u00f0e, bete man georne be \u00f0am \u00fee seo d\u00e6d sy.\nAnd hadbot mid rihte an d\u00e6l \u00feam biscope, o\u00f0er \u00feam wibede & \u00feridde geferscipe.\nAa sceal mid rihte dom \u00e6fter d\u00e6de & medemung be m\u00e6\u00f0e for Gode & for worlde.\nAnd wise w\u00e6ran worldwitan, \u00fee to godcundan rihtlagan \u00feas laga setton, folce for steore, & halidom &",
